    "text": "Gehadedum mannum is swi\u00f0e micclum beboden fram Gode sylfum \u00fe\u00e6t hi gelomlice sceolon \u00fe\u00e6t\nAnd ne \u00feince nanum cristenum menn to langsum \u00fe\u00e6t he gehyre embe Cristes m\u00e6r\u00f0a secgan & hu we\nOn \u00fe\u00e6re cristnunge \u00fee man de\u00f0 \u00e6r \u00feam fulluhte is swi\u00f0e micel getacnunge.\n\u00deonne se m\u00e6ssepreost cristna\u00f0 \u00e6rest \u00fe\u00e6t cild, \u00feonne or\u00f0a\u00f0 he \u00fery on an on hit, \u00feonne hit swa gebyra\u00f0,\n& \u00feonne wyr\u00f0 sona \u00feurh Godes mihte se deofol geyrged & utdrifen, & Criste bi\u00f0 inf\u00e6r gegearcod, &\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t sealt \u00fee se sacerd \u00feam cilde on mu\u00f0 de\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t getacna\u00f0 godcundne wisdom; & eallswa se\nAnd \u00feonne se sacerd him \u00e6tforan sing\u00f0, Credo in Deum patrem, \u00feonne getrymma\u00f0 he his geleafan, &\nAnd \u00feonne se sacerd \u00e6thrin\u00f0 mid his spatle \u00fe\u00e6s mannes nose & his earan, \u00feonne getacna\u00f0 he mid \u00feam\nAnd \u00feonne se sacerd smyra\u00f0 mid \u00feam halgan crisman his breost & his sceoldru, \u00feonne befeh\u00f0 he \u00feone\n\u00deonne is \u00e6fter eallum \u00feisum mid rihtum geleafan to efstanne wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s fontb\u00e6\u00f0es georne.\nAnd \u00feurh \u00fea fonthalgunge \u00f0\u00e6r gewyr\u00f0 sona Godes \u00e6lmihtiges midwist.\nAnd \u00feurh \u00fea or\u00f0unge \u00fee se sacerd on \u00fe\u00e6t font or\u00f0a\u00f0 \u00feonne he \u00feone font halga\u00f0, sona wyr\u00f0 se deofol\nAnd \u00feonne se sacerd on \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6ter de\u00f0 \u00feone gehalgodan tapor, \u00feonne wyr\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6ter samnunga mid\nAnd eall \u00fe\u00e6t se sacerd de\u00f0 \u00feurh \u00fea halgunge \u00feenunge gesewenlice, eall hit fulfreme\u00f0 se halga gast\nAnd \u00fea \u00fereo dyfinga on \u00feam fontb\u00e6\u00f0e, \u00fea getacnia\u00f0 \u00fea halgan \u00ferynnesse, \u00fe\u00e6s f\u00e6der & \u00fe\u00e6s suna & \u00fe\u00e6s\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t hwyte hr\u00e6gl \u00fee man \u00feone mann mid befeh\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t getacna\u00f0 \u00feone gastlican wlite \u00fee se mann\nAnd mid \u00feam crism smyrelse & mid \u00feam crism cla\u00f0e \u00fee man him on ufan \u00fe\u00e6t heafod de\u00f0, man\nFor\u00fean gif he \u00fe\u00e6t gehealt, he bi\u00f0 Criste to bearne geteald, & he bi\u00f0 swi\u00f0e wel \u00fees cynehelmes wur\u00f0e\nHe is ealra f\u00e6der, & \u00fe\u00e6t we geswutelia\u00f0 \u00feonne we singa\u00f0 ure pater noster.\nEalswa bealdlice se \u00feeowa clypa\u00f0 & nama\u00f0 on his pater noster his Drihten him to f\u00e6der swa se hlaford,\nMid gelicum wur\u00f0e Crist bohte \u00feone kasere & \u00feone rican kyning & \u00feone earming; \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s mid his\nBe \u00feam we magon ongitan & oncnawan \u00fe\u00e6t we synd ealle gebro\u00f0ra & eac geswustra \u00feonne we ealle to\n\u00deonne eac \u00e6fter \u00feisum bi\u00f0 se man swi\u00f0e wel wur\u00f0e & him gebyra\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t swi\u00f0e rihte \u00fe\u00e6t he sy\u00f0\u00f0an\nCrist is eallra cristenra heafod, & ealle cristene menn syndon to Cristes limum getealde.\n\u00deonne is \u00fe\u00e6t swi\u00f0e micel \u00feearf \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6ghwilc cristen man \u00fe\u00e6t understande & his cristendom mid rihte\nSe gehealt his cristendom rihtlice se \u00f0e Criste mid rihte gehyr\u00f0; \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0 se \u00f0e his bebodu gehealde\u00f0 &\nGodes agen bebod is \u00fe\u00e6t man lufige God sylfne mid eallum mode & mid eallum m\u00e6gene, & o\u00f0er is\n\u00c6lc cristen man is o\u00f0res nehsta, for\u00feam we synd \u00feurh cristendom ealle gebro\u00f0ra.\nNe bebode nan cristen man o\u00f0rum buton \u00fe\u00e6t he wille \u00fe\u00e6t him sylfum geboden si; \u00feonne ne misbyt nan\nEall \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nig mann o\u00f0rum on \u00feysum lyfe ge\u00f0e\u00f0 to hearme & to unrihte, eall hit sceal him sylfum on\nSe bi\u00f0 swi\u00f0e ges\u00e6lig \u00fee \u00feis wile unde